      ],
      "en": "Jotham was twenty-five years old when he began to reign, and he reigned sixteen years in Jerusalem. His mother’s name was Jerushah the daughter of Zadok.",
      "ko": "요담이 위에 나아갈 때에 나이 이십 오세라 예루살렘에서 십 륙년을 치리하니라 그 모친의 이름은 여루사라 사독의 딸이더라",
      "source_text_hash": "675ce1d106bf4354bc60f97586c38721d095b9f635bac74e531fc64e6e054b74",
      "translation_text_hash": "d8e5587ac94aaa7e037ca6de14c9b30e8339aeba438854dfdc3a6fecca6e8b21",
