      "en": "Now the rest of the acts of Jotham, and all his wars and his ways, behold, they are written in the book of the kings of Israel and Judah.",
      "ko": "요담의 남은 사적과 그 모든 전쟁과 행위는 이스라엘과 유다 열왕기에 기록되니라",
      "source_text_hash": "4faf98aa7eccd83b2908d46021e2667f5c077d93a58569411fad90103dc810f4",
      "translation_text_hash": "68ce88bb97c03eeb8521e921d9acab4c4e8386725b105dd1cbd605d20d9bf062",
